---
description: UI and design system conventions
globs: src/components/**,src/app/**/*.tsx
---

- Design tokens are Tailwind v4 theme variables in `src/app/globals.css`: paper, canvas,
  surface, ink, ink-2, muted, line, accent (terracotta, candidate side), employer (blue,
  console), success. Use them; do not introduce raw hex colours.
- Fonts: Schibsted Grotesk (sans), JetBrains Mono for small uppercase labels (`<Mono>`).
- Fluid spacing uses `clamp(..., Ncqi, ...)` against the `.avsar-root` container.
- Radius: cards 16–24px, images 24–28px, buttons fully rounded.
- Candidate pages: generous, warm, photographic. Console: dense, calm, tables.
- Accessibility: real labels, `aria-current` on active nav, `sr-only` where text is visual
  only, focus states visible, `dir` respected (Arabic is RTL: use `start/end`, not left/right).
- Mobile first. Test at 360px wide. No horizontal page scroll; wide tables use `.scroll-x`.
